OL,3,GNEWSAFoil balloon blamed for fire that
OL,4,Adestroyed homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA forensic investigator has blamed a
OL,7,Ffoil balloon coming into contact with
OL,8,Fpower lines for causing a field fire
OL,9,Fthat destroyed neighbouring homes.
OL,11,FUK Power Networks (UKPN) said an
OL,12,Findependent investigation concluded
OL,13,Fthat a foil helium balloon becoming
OL,14,Fcaught on overhead lines was the likely
OL,15,Fcause of the blaze in Kenninghall,
OL,16,FNorfolk, last month.
OL,18,FIn an email to affected residents, seen
OL,19,Fby the BBC, the forensic investigator
OL,20,Fsaid they found debris on equipment
OL,21,Fattached to a pole in the field next to
OL,22,Fthe properties in Wood Close.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
