OL,3,GNEWSAFoil balloon blamed for fire that
OL,4,Adestroyed homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSiobhan Fulcher, whose home of 12 years
OL,7,Fburnt down, said she was "shocked and
OL,8,Fdisappointed" and wanted more answers.
